  m_text: Testing out text box and how big it should potentially be. We can use auto
    sizing for the text box. The text can either fully appear on screen or by character.
    Again this is all just testing, I'll keep working on it and see what y'all's
    feedback sugguest. We should also be careful of word vomit. Just so the test
    doesn't get too long or make the text box feel crowded. Keeping the text box
    (not the BG box) at 50 feels like it's the best move.
